}}\pard\pardeftab720\sa320\partightenfactor0

\f2\b0\fs32 \cf3 \cb4 Listens to the other person speaking, translates their words into the user's preferred language, and privately suggests suitable responses. It helps users communicate naturally and confidently without needing to visibly use a traditional translation app during every conversation.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa320\partightenfactor0

\f3\b\fs48 \cf3 5. Unlike\cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://github.com/hassande188-collab/product-vision.md/blob/main/product-vision.md#5-unlike"}}{\fldrslt 
