}}\pard\pardeftab720\sa320\partightenfactor0

\f2\b0\fs32 \cf3 \cb4 Traditional translation apps that often require users to type text, hold up their phones, or openly play translated speech, interrupting the flow of conversation.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa320\partightenfactor0

\f3\b\fs48 \cf3 6. Our Difference\cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://github.com/hassande188-collab/product-vision.md/blob/main/product-vision.md#6-our-difference"}}{\fldrslt 
