}}\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f2\b0\fs32 \cf3 \cb4 Assistance Translator provides discreet, real-time translation and personalized response suggestions, helping users understand conversations and reply naturally while keeping the translation assistance private from casual observation. Its goal is to make communication easier, more comfortable, and more independent for people living or traveling abroad.\
